BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:29622319@learn.canterbury.ac.nz
SUMMARY:Quiz 6 (due 5pm Friday 27 March) opens
DESCRIPTION:This quiz covers content from week 5 as well as revision.\n\nEM
	TH210 quizzes are partially mastery-based:\n\n	* If you get 90% OR HIGHER\,
	 you get FULL CREDIT for the quiz (everything ≥ 90% counts the same).\n	* I
	f you get between 40% AND 90%\, you get the mark you earned for the quiz.\n
		* If you get LOWER THAN 40%\, you get NO CREDIT. In that case\, you should
	 study what you struggled with\, e.g. with tutorial questions\, and try aga
	in 😊.\n\nYour best 10 OUT OF 12 quizzes count.\n\n
	
CLASS:PUBLIC
LAST-MODIFIED:20260318T213044Z
DTSTAMP:20260325T022033Z
DTSTART:20260320T040000Z
DTEND:20260320T040000Z
CATEGORIES:EMTH210-26S1
END:VEVENT
