UID:30172257@learn.canterbury.ac.nz
SUMMARY:Planned system maintenance for AKO|LEARN will take place on Wednesd
	ay 25 Mar 2026 at 10:00pm  for ~45 mins
	
DESCRIPTION:AKO|LEARN will be unavailable from Wednesday 25 Mar 2026 at 10:
	00pm to Wednesday 25 Mar 2026 at 10:45pm for a planned system maintenance. 
	We apologise for any inconvenience this outage may cause. Please do not att
	empt to complete or submit any assignments\, quizzes\, workshops\, etc over
	 this period.\n
	
